  "details": "Sometimes, upon joining a world, OnPlayerDataUpdated() fires with `infos` containing all of the existing keys, but the `State` on each `PlayerData.Info` is set to Added instead of Restored. I have not found any rhyme or reason to why this happens, but it seems to be happening more frequently lately.\n\nThis is happening on whatever client version was recent as of 2025/09/09.",
